{"seq":1,"slug":"selection-framework","title":"选型框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/selection-framework","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"workload-analysis-methodology","title":"工作负载分析方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/selection-framework/workload-analysis-methodology","wordCount":1662,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"cap-theorem-tradeoffs","title":"CAP 定理与取舍决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/selection-framework/cap-theorem-tradeoffs","wordCount":1733,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-performance-modeling","title":"成本与性能建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/selection-framework/cost-performance-modeling","wordCount":1593,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"选型框架\">选型框架</h1><p>数据库选型的第一步不是翻产品文档，而是量化自己的工作负载。本章从工作负载分析方法起步，通过 CAP 定理把「技术要求」转化为「取舍决策」，最后用成本与性能建模把决策落到可比较的数字上。三篇文档构成一个完整的决策漏斗：识别需求、确定约束、评估方案。</p>\n"}